=== On ===

You press the power button and, with a loud click, the TV begins to hum.

The screen flickers before fully turning on. Seems the last channel it was on was the local news.

“-gation of the ongoing search is still underway,” the reporter states, “but rest assured that the police won’t stop until the boy is-”

The TV suddenly shuts off, and you look up to see Mildred with the remote.

She puts a finger to her lips, <b>shushing</b> you as she points upstairs.


-> END